    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Scalp: a solution (eg, fluocinolone 0.01%) if shampoos don't relieve itch, used only as needed. Beard and eyebrows: lower potency (eg, triamcinolone 0.025%). Face and folds: hydrocortisone 1 to 2.5% or hydrocortisone valerate 0.2% twice daily; avoid higher potency on the face"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
